  "description": "AI lead screening for Webority.Ads: screens and classifies each lead-form lead as spam, unqualified or qualified through Webority.Ai.Judgment, records the verdict on the AdLead, always hands the lead to the product's handler, and queues a qualified-lead conversion for a confident qualified answer. Kept out of the core so a product without AI pulls in no AI dependencies.",
